              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: what did endukaṇṭē mean?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఇవాళ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఇవాళ (ivāḷa) — \"today\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The farewells gave you రేపు, \"tomorrow\", inside రేపు కలుద్దాం. The day you are actually standing in had no name until now."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It begins with the same ఇ- as ఇక్కడ and ఇది: the near one, the one right here. ఇవాళ (ivāḷa) is the near day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The day you are in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ivāḷa",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ivāḷa*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "ivāḷa, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ivāḷa*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "say ivāḷa, then rēpu, and say which is nearer",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: say *ivāḷa*, then *rēpu*, and say which is nearer]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say bhōjanaṁ, then say ivāḷa",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *bhōjanaṁ*, then say *ivāḷa*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
