        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ఎప్పుడు వస్తారు?",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎప్పుడు వస్తారు? (eppuḍu vastāru?) — \"when will you come?\". The new word in it is ఎప్పుడు, \"when?\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The last gap in the ఎ- question row: ఎక్కడ where, ఎవరు who, ఎందుకు why, and now ఎప్పుడు when. The row is complete."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The three days you just learned are its answers, and మీరు in front of it makes the question respectful."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The question the three days answer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
