        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: సంవత్సరం",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సంవత్సరం (saṁvatsaraṁ) — \"a year\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A Sanskrit tatsama, wearing the same -ం ending you have seen on ఉదయం and భోజనం. Telugu also says ఏడు for a year of age, but సంవత్సరం (saṁvatsaraṁ) is the plain calendar word."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You now have the hour (గంట), the day (రోజు), the month (నెల) and the year — the whole ladder of Telugu time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The largest unit of time you can name."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
